{"id":47306,"ord":18,"n_segments":152,"prev":47305,"next":47307,"doc":{"id":"61125","title":"61125_Teddy Bunn oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Theodore Leroy Bunn","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/61125/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=61125"},"chapter":"Harlem, the Cotton Club and Duke Ellington","title":"A revue girl takes him to Georgia in 1940","category":"touring_travel","summary":"One of the Cotton Club-type revue girls took care of him and took him to Plains, Georgia for about a month before he came to California.","period":"1940","year_from":1940,"year_to":1940,"words":158,"start":[25,18],"end":[27,5],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=61125#s47306","tags":{"places":[{"name":"California","focus":1,"type":"state"},{"name":"Georgia","focus":1,"type":"state"},{"name":"Plains","focus":1,"type":"city","in":"Georgia"},{"name":"Los Angeles","focus":0,"type":"city"}],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[{"name":"The woman","qid":null,"n":2},{"name":"Jimmy Carter","qid":"Q23685","n":2}],"story":{"theme":13,"theme_name":"Medicine shows, minstrels, circuses and the black theater circuit","community":23,"community_name":"On the road with minstrel, carnival and tent shows","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":25,"b":18,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Them guys had a lot of women, boy. I remember that. One of them out of the show brought me to California."},{"p":26,"b":0,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"You mean from -- when you came out, you mean?"},{"p":26,"b":1,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"When I came out here."},{"p":26,"b":2,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"I see."},{"p":26,"b":3,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"And she got a job downtown, when the colored shows was in L.A."},{"p":26,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Uh-huh."},{"p":26,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"She got a job there and stayed."},{"p":26,"b":6,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Well --"},{"p":26,"b":7,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"But she took care of me and when I went to -- where did -- let's see. Where's that President from?"},{"p":26,"b":8,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Which one?"},{"p":26,"b":9,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"The one we've got now."},{"p":26,"b":10,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Carter."},{"p":26,"b":11,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Georgia."},{"p":26,"b":12,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Yeah. From Georgia."},{"p":26,"b":13,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah. They took me to Georgia, in the same town he was in. I stayed there about a month."},{"p":26,"b":14,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Plains?"},{"p":26,"b":15,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Plains."},{"p":26,"b":16,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Who took you there, the women from the --"},{"p":26,"b":17,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"The woman."},{"p":26,"b":18,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"The woman from the revue."},{"p":26,"b":19,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"One of the revues, yeah, a girl."},{"p":27,"b":0,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"Before you came out here."},{"p":27,"b":1,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Before I came to California, yeah."},{"p":27,"b":2,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"What was that, about 1941?"},{"p":27,"b":3,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"1940."},{"p":27,"b":4,"s":"MR. ROSENBERG","x":"'40."},{"p":27,"b":5,"s":"MR. BUNN","x":"Yeah."}]}